@set gold = 12
@set swords = 0
@set loaves = 0
You have {{gold}} gold. [[Go into the shop]](shop)

[[shop]]:
"What'll it be?" asks the shopkeeper. You have {{gold}} gold.

{{#if gold >= 5}}[[Buy a sword (5 gold)]](shop, gold -= 5, swords += 1){{else}}You can't afford a sword.{{/if}}

{{#if gold >= 2}}[[Buy a loaf (2 gold)]](shop, gold -= 2, loaves += 1){{else}}You can't afford a loaf.{{/if}}

[[Leave the shop]](outside)

[[outside]]:
@end
You leave the shop with {{gold}} gold left. Swords: {{swords}}. Loaves: {{loaves}}.
